   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Putting ideas in order",
     "texto": [
      "A B2 text does not drop ideas all at once: it **numbers** them and **adds** them up. These words go at the start of the sentence, followed by a comma:",
      "**To begin with:** **Trước hết,** / **Trước tiên,** / **Thứ nhất,** = first of all.",
      "**To continue:** **Thứ hai,** (second) · **Thứ ba,** (third) · **Tiếp theo,** (next).",
      "**To add:** **Ngoài ra,** (in addition) · **Hơn nữa,** (what's more) · **Bên cạnh đó,** (besides that) · **Không chỉ vậy,** (and not only that).",
      "**To close the list:** **Cuối cùng,** (finally).",
      "Fine difference: «ngoài ra» adds **another thing** from the same list. «Hơn nữa» adds something **stronger**, which reinforces what came before."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
